# iEye landing — environment template
#
# Phase 1 (this site) needs NO secrets and reads no env vars. This file is a
# placeholder for Phase 1.5+ (#42/#43), when the forms are wired to Firebase.
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in once the BytesBrains Firebase project
# exists. All client Firebase config values are PUBLIC by design (they identify
# the project, they are not secrets) — but real secrets (Airwallex keys, admin
# credentials) must NEVER live here; they belong in Cloud Functions / a secret
# manager. See #43 "Security & privacy (CISO gate)".

# VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
# VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
# VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
# VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
# VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
# VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
